"""
KryptonOS System Settings (GTK 3.0 + Catppuccin Mocha Dark Theme)
Uses GTK 3.0 (identical to blueman-manager with OpenGL/Cairo Wayland rendering)
so it launches reliably on VMware svga/vmwgfx without Vulkan driver crashes.
"""
